6. Process Flow Alignment (AGENTS.md)
=====================================

The core process flow from AGENTS.md remains fully intact:

SO (Sales Order)
  → Costing Sheet (5 subforms auto-expanded from SO × System Composition × BOM)  ← No SO approval gate; Costing created on SO save
    → Costing Approved → auto-create Project + Production Plan  ← Unchanged
      → Production Plan Released → auto-PR for stock shortages  ← Plan now FG-wise; PR via BOM
        → MR auto-derived from Costing Sheet (4 cost pre-filled; Draft → Pending → Verified → Approved → Released)  ← MR derives RM from FG costing
          → MR Released [CRITICAL GATE]  ← Unchanged
            → auto-MIS → Store issues RM to Production  ← Unchanged
              → Production (BMR → RM Consumption → Packing)  ← Unchanged
                → FGHM (FG Handover → FG Stock +)  ← Unchanged
                  → Site Consumption Entry (hourly/daily per area)  ← Unchanged
                    → Material Return (unused RM back to Store)  ← Unchanged
                      → Project Close → P&L (+₹31,000)  ← Unchanged

